Bound optional IOSurface import retains and propagate GPU pressure to the frontend/runtime.
Only safe cache ownership is dropped; textures and commands keep their real resources.
Capacity failures get one frontend retry after the runtime call and all import locks unwind.
This does not change the terminal WindowServer capture failure boundary.

